│ lag.\n2.  **Guard Thresholds:** The ground truth peaks slightly below 25.    │
│ The hard guard `x1 >= 25` delays the transition from Mode 1 to 2.\n3.        │
│ **Mode 2/3 Decay:** The simulated recovery (downward trajectory) is slower   │
│ than the ground truth, further extending the                                 │
│ period.\n\n**Recommendations:**\n*   **Adjust Mode 1:** Increase the growth  │
